"Plug the OpenMV Cam into your computer via USB. A blue heartbeat LED blinks "
"when it's ready."
msgstr ""
"Kytke OpenMV Cam tietokoneeseen USB:n kautta. Sininen sykkivä LED vilkkuu, "
